Houdry Agent
============

Houdry Agent is a branded distribution of Hermes Agent for use with the
Houdry private GPU fabric (https://github.com/houdry-genomex/houdry).

This software includes code from Hermes Agent by Nous Research:

  Project:  https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
  Website:  https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com
