contributors, also under the MIT License.

Hermes Agent is open source and may be used by anyone under its MIT terms.
Houdry Agent does not claim ownership of Hermes; we redistribute and adapt
it with attribution as required by the license.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses; see package metadata
in this repository (Python, Node, and Electron components).
